            "review_title": "Review at Tandoor Lé Thành Tôn",
            "review_text": "Dương Minh Thông\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam48 contributions\n0\nOne of the best Indian restaurant in town 🤤✨\nAug 2025 • Friends\nSeeing my favorite tiktoker recommended this place so I gave it a try. And this restaurant is better than I expected. The service is dope, nice consultants. I recommend Pani Puri (9/10) and Fish Masala (8.5/10).\nWritten August 9, 2025\nTandoor Restaurants in Saigon\n🙏 Thank you so much for giving us a try after seeing the recommendation – we’re thrilled to hear we exceeded your expectations! ✨🤩 We’re glad you enjoyed the service and loved the Pani Puri and Fish Masala. 🍽️ Your kind words motivate our team to keep delivering authentic and flavorful Indian cuisine.\nWe look forward to welcoming you back soon to try even more dishes from our menu! 💛\n– The Tandoor Team\nRead more\nWritten September 5, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
