            "review_title": "Review at Tandoor Lé Thành Tôn",
            "review_text": "Paradise06790933273\n1 contribution\n0\nOne of the best Indian cuisine in the heart of Ho Chi Minh City.\nDec 2024 • Family\nTonight I alongwith with my dad,mom and sis dined at Tandoor in Ho Chi Minh City, and it was an outstanding experience. The food was excellent—each dish was packed with authentic Indian flavors and perfectly spiced offering a delightful combination of taste and texture. The ambiance was warm and inviting, with attentive staff ensuring a smooth dining experience. Tandoor is a must-visit for anyone craving high-quality Indian cuisine in the heart of the city!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 27, 2024\nTandoor Restaurants in Saigon\nThank you so much for your thoughtful and beautifully written review! We're truly honored that you chose to dine with us as a family and that you had such a memorable experience. It means the world to us to know that you enjoyed the authentic flavors, warm ambiance, and attentive service. We’ll be sure to share your kind words with the whole team. We look forward to welcoming you and your family back to Tandoor soon!\nRead more\nWritten May 26, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
