            "review_text": "Shruti Pramod Reddy\nBengaluru, India41 contributions\n0\nindian dinner\nDec 2023 • Family\nDined here on Dec-28,2023. \nThis restaurant serves Indian tour groups and accepts bulk bookings for the same.\nHas multiple branches in south Vietnam.\nWritten January 4, 2024\nTandoor Restaurants in Saigon\nDear Shruti Pramod Reddy,\n\nThank you again for choosing to dine at our restaurant during your visit on December 28, 2023. We appreciate your patronage and feedback.\n\nWe do indeed welcome various guests, including Indian tour groups, and offer the option for bulk bookings to accommodate larger parties. Our multiple branches in South Vietnam are designed to provide a diverse and authentic Indian dining experience to a wide range of diners.\n\nYour feedback is important to us, and we will continue to strive for excellence in serving our guests. If you have any specific suggestions or comments about your dining experience, please feel free to share them with us. We value your input as it helps us improve and enhance our services.\n\nOnce again, thank you for choosing us for your Indian dinner. We hope to have the opportunity to serve you again in the future and provide you with an even more memorable dining experience.\n\nWarm regards,\n\nThe Tandoor Team\nRead more\nWritten January 15, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
