            "review_text": "Vikram K\nPune, India33 contributions\n1\nBest Indian Food in Ho Chi Minh\nNov 2023 • Family\nAuthentic Indian Food. The ambience is also very nice. They also have another branch in Hanoi where the food is also good.\nThey have variety of Indian food dishes to choose from.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 10, 2023\nTandoor Restaurants in Saigon\nDear Vikram,\n\nThank you for taking the time to share your positive review with us! We're thrilled to hear that you enjoyed our authentic Indian food and found the ambiance very nice.\n\nIt's great to know that you're also familiar with our branch in Hanoi and that you had a good experience there as well. Have you seen yet the full re-design and new menu they provide? As you probably know, we take pride in offering a wide variety of Indian dishes to cater to different tastes, and we're delighted to hear that you found a selection that you enjoyed.\n\nYour feedback is truly appreciated, and we hope to have the pleasure of serving you again in the future. If you ever have any specific preferences or suggestions, please feel free to let us know.\n\nWarm regards,\n\nThe Tandoor Team\nRead more\nWritten December 7, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
