            "review_text": "Scott N\nBrisbane, Australia3 contributions\n1\nGood restaurant but could be great\nJul 2023 • Couples\nExcellent service, for was good and flavour was awesome but it is apparent that the chef is cost saving, a couple of Chunks of meat on the sauce and very little mince in the keema nan. Would definately come again tho\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 6, 2023\nTandoor Restaurants in Saigon\nDear Scott,\n\nThank you for taking the time to leave your feedback, we're pleased to hear that you had an excellent service experience and found the flavor of our food to be awesome. Your kind words are appreciated.\n\nWe also appreciate your constructive feedback regarding the portion sizes and the mince in the keema naan. We take all feedback seriously, and your comments will be shared with our kitchen team to ensure we maintain the high standards we strive for.\n\nWe're delighted to hear that you will come back again, and we look forward to serving you on your next visit. If you ever have any specific preferences or requests, please don't hesitate to let us know. Your satisfaction is our priority.\n\nWarm regards,\n\nThe Tandoor Team\nRead more\nWritten December 7, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
